{"version":1,"key":"article:15","content":{"id":15,"title":"Ajax跨域","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05f4e5af-0ed6-4df3-8033-da8cb243c9b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本篇文章介绍什么是跨域，以及跨域的解决办法。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7087d3bd-9a37-4a10-aac8-68a407a860b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同源策略"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06365e33-3782-40b2-94da-c1e0d1fe0ea2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是同源策略：同 domain(或IP)，同端口，同协议视为同一个域，一个域内的脚本仅仅具有本域内的权限，可以理解为本域脚本只能读写本域内的资源，而无法访问其它域的资源，这种安全限制称为同源策略。我们看几个例子判断两个链接是否是同源"}]},{"type":"table","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","collabId":"1ff09c42-ff1c-4eb2-b338-4eae9f9c1dc2","children":[{"type":"table-row","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","collabId":"f7aa3516-4958-4afe-9402-2f621db05cae","children":[{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"5cc416a7-cd13-4454-8ce9-7c6c0f88d75f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"url1"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b821d65b-4d8f-4eae-9ea3-879860de4c1f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"url2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"6ca5fbb0-f26a-4570-91d1-ea6a98544e9e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是否同源"}]},{"type":"table-cell","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","collabId":"b213ec8b-8a59-4500-984f-355c3e34981c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原因"}]}]},{"typ